{
 "encounter_id": "00747",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Morning. Awful weather, isn't it? Did the bus get you here all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. Late, though. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Well, you're here. What can I do for you? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Constipation. Getting worse. Six months now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's normal for you, normally?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Every day. Now it's every four, five days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are the stools hard?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Rock hard. I strain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else with it, bloating, pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bloated, yes. And cramps, low down on the left."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood when you go?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Black stools?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weight loss that you've noticed?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Vomiting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, never."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Codeine, 30 mg, twice a day, for my back. And lactulose, 15 ml, twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. The codeine is often a culprit. Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Aspirin. Makes me wheeze."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's in your history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Haemorrhoids. A slipped disc. And anxiety."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Appendix, 1998."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Bowel problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had bowel cancer. In his seventies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And how's your diet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "White bread, mostly. Not much fruit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I sit at a desk all day. No exercise."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you over. Pulse 74, blood pressure 128 over 80, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 16, and weight 82 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All fine. Lie back, I'll feel your tummy.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cold hands. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sorry. It's soft, but tender in the lower left. And the bowel sounds are normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's where it hurts. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can't feel any lumps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your water, passing urine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything like a cough or breathlessness, with your aspirin wheeze?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I'm fine with that. Haven't had it for years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I think the codeine is the main cause of this constipation, along with the low fibre."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Can I stop it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not suddenly. We'll talk about the back pain. I'd like to arrange blood tests for thyroid and calcium, and a stool test for blood, because of your father."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And eat more fibre, oats, fruit, and drink water."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll try. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Right. ~"
  }
